# The image builds from a clean checkout: nothing local, nothing secret, and
# nothing the build doesn't read, so editing docs doesn't rebuild it.
.git
.claude
**/.turbo
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/test
coverage
docs
*.md
Dockerfile
compose.yaml
*.log
.DS_Store

# State and secrets never go in an image.
apps/server/data
backups
**/.env
**/.env.*
